    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43691" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sē-pār</span></b> ,
		păris (perh. only in <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>abl. sing.</i>), adj.,
				<i>separate</i>, <i>different</i>
			(syn. dispar; postAug. and mostly <b>poet.</b>)'
