				 <i><span class="en">Prud. Apoth. 311</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">duo flumina naturā separi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sol. 7 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
